    <string name="rename_title">Update folder names</string>
    <string name="rename_subtitle">Old 01 / 15 folders → January / January_15</string>
    <string name="rename_info">Older versions made folders like 2024 / 01 / 15 or 2024 / March / March 7. This gives them the current names (2024 / January / January_15, March_07) so everything sorts the same way. If both an old and a new folder exist for the same day, their photos are merged; identical files are never duplicated. Nothing is deleted.</string>
