    <string name="organize_subtitle">Any folder → Year / Month / Day</string>
    <string name="fix_subtitle">Give undated photos their folder\'s date</string>
    <string name="organize_info">For a messy folder — camera dumps, WhatsApp, Screenshots, old phone backups, sub-folders and all. Each photo and video is copied to Output / Year / Month / Day using the date inside the file or in its name (IMG_20240315…). Files with no date go to no-date/ (keeping their sub-folders); anything unreadable goes to error/. Your originals are never changed.</string>
